<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(When I think about what the Social and Content Coordinator role could look like, I don't picture 'running social media.' I picture telling the story of a company that started with one family restaurant in Barrie and is now three brands wide and growing by the week.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

250 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(MHRA didn't get here by accident. Stocked scaled from one franchise to a hundred stores. Holy Chuck was brought in because it already had a following worth protecting. YLK & Batter is the newest chapter, and it's still being written. One philosophy runs through all three: build around what already works.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

251 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 208 0 R/E(That's what I'd bring to social: create better content, understand what performs, learn from the audience, and do more of what works. My BBA from GLS University and my postgraduate certificate in Digital and Content Marketing from York University give me the creative, customer-facing half of that. My postgraduate certificate in Information Systems Business Analysis from George Brown College gives me the other half: reading the numbers, spotting the pattern, and turning what we learn into the next decision.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

